test/check/error-atomic-and-defined-use.sumspec:10:1:
   |
10 | Level = Low | High
   | ^
Level is declared in __atomics and also defined

test/check/error-atomic-and-defined-use.sumspec:11:1:
   |
11 | Ids = [Id]
   | ^
Ids is declared in __atomics and also defined

test/check/error-atomic-and-defined-use.sumspec:12:1:
   |
12 | Mode = Off | On
   | ^
Mode is declared in __atomics and also defined

test/check/error-atomic-and-defined-use.sumspec:14:24:
   |
14 | variant :: App => Mode.Off -> Mode.On
   |                        ^
Mode has no variants, so .Off is invalid

test/check/error-atomic-and-defined-use.sumspec:14:36:
   |
14 | variant :: App => Mode.Off -> Mode.On
   |                                    ^
Mode has no variants, so .On is invalid

test/check/error-atomic-and-defined-use.sumspec:15:28:
   |
15 | args Id#i :: App => Ids -> Ids(i)
   |                            ^
Ids takes no arguments

test/check/error-atomic-and-defined-use.sumspec:16:39:
   |
16 | member Id#i :: App => Ids#ids // i in ids -> Ids'
   |                                       ^
ids is a Ids, not a list, so nothing can be in it

